WrongGPU: third-party notices
=============================

WrongGPU's own code is under the MIT licence (LICENSE). This file lists every third-party component in this
repository or used to build or test it, with its version, licence and where it is used.

No file, code, kernel or model data of the upscaler WrongGPU re-implements (named in README.md) is included in this
repository. The model weights are read on the player's own PC from that upscaler's file, which the player already has
(see README.md and docs/CLEAN-ROOM.md).


