3. Not included; used at run time on the player's PC
----------------------------------------------------

    Windows' own d3d12.dll / dxgi.dll; AMD's driver and, optionally, the AMD HIP runtime (amdhip64_7.dll);
    the game's own AMD FidelityFX DLLs (renamed by the launcher, never modified or redistributed); the player's
    own file of the original upscaler (read by the converter on the player's PC, never redistributed); OptiScaler (its own
    project, GPL-3.0; the launcher downloads the WrongGPU edition from its own release page, it is not part of
    this repository or of WrongGPU's packages).


